posts.text:
Libraries remain an essential service in the digital age and as generative AI makes information online less reliable.

@parismarx.com spoke to Hannah Cyrus & @flexlibris.bsky.social about how libraries are helping patrons gain a critical view on tech and AI.

Full ep: techwontsave.us/episode/338_...

